   "answer": "b",
   "hint": "Think of Carnot's theorem.",
   "explain": "The maximum efficiency depends only on \\(T_1\\) and \\(T_2\\) (\\(\\eta=1-T_2/T_1\\)). The caloric idea was the part that was wrong."
  },
